%s:5 PhanAttributeWrongTarget Saw use of attribute \SensitiveParameter declared at internal:0 which supports being declared on \Attribute::TARGET_PARAMETER but it was declared on public string $password which requires an attribute declared to support \Attribute::TARGET_PROPERTY
